WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.775 --> 00:00:04.188
- [Brent] Great season, everyone.

00:00:04.188 --> 00:00:05.988
That finale had me in tears.
- Yes, fantastic.

00:00:05.988 --> 00:00:07.718
- Will Smith!
- Will Smith!

00:00:07.718 --> 00:00:08.824
- [Brent] Yes, there he is.

00:00:08.824 --> 00:00:10.289
- Fresh Prince himself.
- The man himself.

00:00:10.289 --> 00:00:12.385
- Great job, Janet.

00:00:12.385 --> 00:00:14.846
That Aunt Viv finger-point you did,

00:00:14.846 --> 00:00:16.321
you knocked it out of the ball park.

00:00:16.321 --> 00:00:17.238
- Thank you.

00:00:17.238 --> 00:00:19.952
- Hey, could we talk to you in my office?

00:00:19.952 --> 00:00:21.118
- Yeah, I don't see why not.

00:00:21.118 --> 00:00:22.346
- Janet, please have a seat.

00:00:22.346 --> 00:00:24.680
Can we get you anything,
coffee, tea, kleenex?

00:00:24.680 --> 00:00:25.805
Because you're about to be fired.

00:00:25.805 --> 00:00:27.280
- Excuse me?

00:00:27.280 --> 00:00:29.139
Fired, what do you mean fired?

00:00:29.139 --> 00:00:30.577
- Shhh, calm down, okay?

00:00:30.577 --> 00:00:32.890
Mary-Kate and Ashley
are sleeping next door.

00:00:33.829 --> 00:00:35.604
- This is ridiculous, what
do you mean I'm fired?

00:00:35.604 --> 00:00:37.543
- Production has cue cards for a reason,

00:00:37.543 --> 00:00:39.157
you can't just be going off-book.

00:00:39.157 --> 00:00:41.699
- You didn't complain when I
went off-book last night, Brent.

00:00:41.699 --> 00:00:44.938
- Okay, Janet, I wouldn't
worry even a little bit.

00:00:44.938 --> 00:00:46.981
There is tons of acting work out there

00:00:46.981 --> 00:00:49.582
for middle-aged African
American women, it's the '90s.

00:00:49.582 --> 00:00:51.044
- Oh really, like what?

00:00:51.044 --> 00:00:52.124
Name one show.

00:00:52.124 --> 00:00:53.517
- Family Matters, that's a show.

00:00:53.517 --> 00:00:54.760
- Name another show.

00:00:54.760 --> 00:00:55.700
- Step By Step.

00:00:55.700 --> 00:00:56.501
- They are all white.

00:00:56.501 --> 00:00:57.690
- What, no!

00:00:57.690 --> 00:00:59.844
- Cody's like, Filipino or--
- [Brent] Native American.

00:00:59.844 --> 00:01:01.458
- [Janet] He's probably the whitest person

00:01:01.458 --> 00:01:02.538
that's on the show.

00:01:02.538 --> 00:01:03.722
- Oh my god.

00:01:03.722 --> 00:01:07.614
Oh my god, there is a huge
diversity problem in television.

00:01:07.614 --> 00:01:08.620
Anyway, you're still fired.

00:01:08.620 --> 00:01:10.165
- This is out of control, okay?

00:01:10.165 --> 00:01:12.139
This show needs me.

00:01:12.139 --> 00:01:13.183
What are you gonna do, huh?

00:01:13.183 --> 00:01:16.805
Kill me off, make Uncle
Phil a single uncle?

00:01:16.805 --> 00:01:18.106
America won't wanna see that.

00:01:18.106 --> 00:01:21.078
- Oh, this is so embarrassing for you.

00:01:21.078 --> 00:01:23.400
- You think we're gonna kill Aunt Viv?

00:01:23.400 --> 00:01:25.745
- Okay so what are you
gonna do, what am I--

00:01:25.745 --> 00:01:27.188
- Replaced?

00:01:27.742 --> 00:01:29.135
Hi, gentlemen, here's your coffee.

00:01:29.135 --> 00:01:31.291
- Thank you, new Aunt Viv.
- New Aunt Viv.

00:01:31.291 --> 00:01:32.648
- New Aunt Viv?

00:01:32.648 --> 00:01:34.915
Are you joking me right now?

00:01:34.915 --> 00:01:37.795
- No, no, we're not the jokesters,
but new Aunt Viv sure is.

00:01:37.795 --> 00:01:40.361
- That wasn't an earthquake,
Uncle Phil was jumping rope.

00:01:40.361 --> 00:01:43.111
(laughing)

00:01:43.111 --> 00:01:45.493
- That is what we're talking
about, that is comedy.

00:01:45.493 --> 00:01:47.188
- Are you being serious right now?

00:01:47.188 --> 00:01:48.186
We don't even look alike.

00:01:48.186 --> 00:01:49.370
- I think you do.

00:01:49.370 --> 00:01:50.113
- Yeah, me too.

00:01:50.113 --> 00:01:51.971
- Look it, you squint
your eyes and do this.

00:01:51.971 --> 00:01:53.608
Which one's which; who are we firing?

00:01:53.608 --> 00:01:55.895
- Okay you know what, stop it.

00:01:55.895 --> 00:01:59.668
I am a pinnacle in this
show and I can't be replaced

00:01:59.668 --> 00:02:01.734
by some wanna-be.

00:02:01.734 --> 00:02:03.151
I said a wanna-be.

00:02:03.151 --> 00:02:04.611
What's wrong with her?
- Oh, she's a robot.

00:02:04.611 --> 00:02:06.065
Now Janet, if you just
wanna grab your things--

00:02:06.065 --> 00:02:07.190
- A robot?!

00:02:07.190 --> 00:02:08.410
- Yeah well, they're easy to work with

00:02:08.410 --> 00:02:09.848
and they don't go off-book.

00:02:09.848 --> 00:02:11.289
- It's the new wave, Janet.

00:02:11.289 --> 00:02:13.669
- Holly Robinson Peete from
Hangin' with Mister Cooper?

00:02:13.669 --> 00:02:14.331
Robot.

00:02:14.331 --> 00:02:16.269
- Lisa from Saved by the Bell, robot.

00:02:16.269 --> 00:02:18.208
- Dustin Diamond was a person,

00:02:18.208 --> 00:02:19.473
replaced him with a robot.

00:02:19.473 --> 00:02:21.147
First white robot.
- [Brent] First white robot.

00:02:21.147 --> 00:02:22.051
- [Brent] Hey, there he is.

00:02:22.051 --> 00:02:23.084
- You know what?

00:02:23.084 --> 00:02:24.628
I am not going, okay?

00:02:24.628 --> 00:02:25.685
I'm not going anywhere.

00:02:25.685 --> 00:02:28.007
Malcom X says a woman
who stands her ground

00:02:28.007 --> 00:02:29.719
is a woman that stands tall--
- [Brunette Man] Security!

00:02:29.719 --> 00:02:31.083
- Are you kidding me?

00:02:31.083 --> 00:02:33.103
You called secur--you know what?

00:02:33.103 --> 00:02:35.669
You won't even know Will
Smith's name in five years.

00:02:35.669 --> 00:02:37.224
What are you gonna do,
put him in a movie about

00:02:37.224 --> 00:02:39.384
an alien invasion where he saves the world

00:02:39.384 --> 00:02:40.730
on any given holiday?

00:02:40.730 --> 00:02:42.076
Let go of me!

00:02:42.076 --> 00:02:43.424
- That's not a bad idea.
- [Brent] Not bad at all.

00:02:43.424 --> 00:02:44.990
- [Brent] Hey Carol, did you hear that?

00:02:44.990 --> 00:02:45.943
- Write that down.

00:02:45.943 --> 00:02:47.789
- New Aunt Viv, do you
know who Malcom X is?

00:02:47.789 --> 00:02:48.950
- No, I do not.

00:02:48.950 --> 00:02:50.610
- Oh, she's perfect!

00:02:50.610 --> 00:02:52.549
- Wanna go to Eddie Bauer
and get some new slacks?

00:02:52.549 --> 00:02:54.401
- You know I do!

